# JARVIS UI rules

## Shell (`components/jarvis/`)

- State lives in `JarvisProvider`; init in `JarvisInit.js`.
- Lazy/dynamic: `CommandPalette`, `BootSequence`, `CursorLayer`, `VoiceController`, `ReactorCanvas`.
- Mount palette/help only when `paletteOpen` / `helpOpen`.
- `ModuleTransition` is a static wrapper — no GSAP route animations.

## Module pages

- Use `ModulePage` for headers; `viewportFit` for no-scroll layouts (about, projects).
- Panel swaps: class `hud-panel-swap` (CSS opacity), not Framer `x`/`y` on first paint.
- `AnimatePresence initial={false}` if animation libraries are required for tab changes.

## Voice (`VoiceController.js`)

- Do not `abort()` mic for TTS; use `speakingRef` to ignore results.
- `no-speech` must not trigger tight restart loops.
- `destroySession` only when voice disabled or unmounting.

## Canvas

- Default: `ReactorBackdrop` (CSS grid only).
- WebGL only when `STORAGE_KEYS.reactor3d === "true"` and hardware checks pass.

## Styles

- Edit `styles/jarvis/*.css`; match existing HUD tokens and `hud-card` patterns.
